>>__ load "boolSimpsExt";
>>__ Parse.temp_set_grammars $ valOf $ grammarDB {thyname="hol"};
## `solver_ss`

``` hol4
simpExtLib.solver_ss : TraverseExt.ssolver -> simpExtLib.ssfrag
```

------------------------------------------------------------------------

Creates an anonymous extension fragment containing one unsafe solver.
Installing it has the same effect as `add_unsafe_solver`.

### Failure

Never fails.

### Example

``` hol4
>> val decide : TraverseExt.ssolver = {name = "decide", solve = K DECIDE};
>> simpExtLib.SIMP_CONV
     (simpExtLib.++ (boolSimpsExt.bool_ss,simpExtLib.solver_ss decide))
     [arithmeticTheory.LESS_MOD] “x MOD (x + 1)”;
```

### See also

[`simpExtLib.add_unsafe_solver`](#simpExtLib.add_unsafe_solver),
[`simpExtLib.safe_solver_ss`](#simpExtLib.safe_solver_ss).
